  "planning_explanation": [
    "ci.yml push defaults are simx/smoke; pull_request defaults are simx,rtlsim/smoke,full.",
    "A push or pull_request toolchain cache miss forces full driver/tier coverage; an indeterminate changed-from diff forces all drivers.",
    "The current Python orchestration, added project tests, and documentation changes match no driver-escalation path in ci/testcase.py.",
    "ci.yml invokes matrix without --changed-from, so category touches metadata does not suppress cells.",
    "There are 17 categories at both XLEN 32 and 64, plus perf at 32 and p02_wgmma/p04_mlp at 64.",
    "The retained base plan had no shards; unchanged planner, catalog, and runtime weights preserve that plan for the same inputs.",
    "model_parity/perf_gate remain centralized RV32 rtlsim checks; logic_gate remains an RV32 rtlsim smoke cell. These were not cells of the retained SimX-only base run.",
    "Dedicated opt-in FPGA/ASIC/timing_gpu workflows and gate baselines are unchanged."
  ],
